to drag all this loot back to the Mines Town
altar; it includes an artifact weapon, katana
SnickerSnee. With Sting, found in Mines Town, this
is cutting into Bat Bait's chances for Magic Bane
quite a bit, when and if a coaligned altar is ever
located.

T:10472, there are never enough identify scrolls.
Bat Bait IDed what he could, primarily his daggers,
enchanted 45 daggers up to +5, the gray dragon scale
